  "description": "Fix & Flip Dream House is interior renovation and design simulator. Step into the shoes of a professional decorator: purchase old properties, clear out the clutter, and transform them into stylish, modern living spaces. Your goal is to completely reinvent the interior by selecting finishing materials, furniture from an extensive catalogue. Painting walls, laying floors, and arranging furniture — every decision you make directly impacts the final value of the home.\n\nKey features:\n\n- Full Renovation Cycle: Buy abandoned properties, demolish old partitions, and completely transform the look of the premises.\n\n- Interior Design and Finishing: A vast catalogue of materials and furniture allows you to paint walls, hang wallpaper, and arrange elements to your taste.\n\n- A Jack of All Trades: Use and upgrade arsenal of tools to speed up your workflow.",
